Use both: Find Hub to locate and lock the phone, CrookCatcher to see who tried to get past the lock. Like Find Hub's settings, it has to be in place before the phone goes missing. CrookCatcher has been downloaded more than 12 million times since 2014 and takes around 1.2 million intruder photos a day. Setup takes a few minutes: see [how to see who tried to unlock your Android phone](/blog/see-who-tried-to-unlock-your-phone).

